---
import ProjectBrief from './ProjectBrief.astro';
const projects=[
 {id:'exterior',name:'Rinse & Rise',line:'Make an entrance.',category:'Exterior care / Confident & kinetic',number:'01',description:'A bold first impression. A direct route from the service to the enquiry.'},
 {id:'pool',name:'Blue Hour',line:'Find your quiet.',category:'Pool care / Calm & considered',number:'02',description:'Space to breathe. A clear service story, with the next step always in reach.'},
 {id:'landscape',name:'Stone & Stream',line:'Room for possibility.',category:'Landscaping / Natural & editorial',number:'03',description:'An editorial approach to outdoor spaces. Grounded, purposeful and made to explore.'}
];
---
<div class="new-studio">
<section class="studio-hero" aria-labelledby="cinema-heading">
 <div class="studio-art" data-tilt aria-hidden="true"><img src="/art/glass-fold.webp" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" alt=""/></div>
 <div class="studio-hero-top"><span>INDEPENDENT DIGITAL STUDIO</span><span>PUNE, INDIA / WORKING EVERYWHERE</span></div>
 <div class="studio-hero-copy"><p class="studio-overline">DESIGN. BUILD. MAKE IT MATTER.</p><h1 id="cinema-heading">A website that<br/> <span>feels ahead.</span></h1><p>For businesses with something<br/>worth putting into the world.</p><a class="studio-link" href="#cinema-work">Enter the work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div>
 <div class="studio-hero-bottom"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span><p>Distinctive by design.<br/>Simple where it matters.</p><span>01 — 03</span></div>
</section>
<section class="selected-work" id="cinema-work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
 <div class="work-stage">
  <div class="work-rail"><h2 id="work-title">Selected directions</h2><span>ORIGINAL CONCEPTS / NOT CLIENT COMMISSIONS</span></div>
  <div class="work-art" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/art/glass-fold.webp" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt=""/><span class="work-art-rule"></span></div>
  <div class="work-panels">{projects.map(p=><a class={`work-panel work-${p.id}`} data-work-panel={p.id} href={`/showcase/${p.id}/`}><span class="work-count">{p.number} / DESIGN EXPLORATION</span><h3>{p.name}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p class="work-tagline">{p.line}</p><p class="work-description">{p.description}</p><span class="work-category">{p.category}</span><span class="work-disclosure">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span></a>)}</div>
  <div class="work-controls" role="group" aria-label="Choose a design direction">{projects.map((p,i)=><button type="button" data-work-select={p.id} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}><span>{p.number}</span> {p.name}</button>)}</div>
  <p class="work-status sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-work-status>Rinse &amp; Rise concept selected.</p>
  <div class="work-stage-bottom"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE · SELECT TO OPEN</span><span data-work-position>01 / 03</span></div>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="studio-statement" aria-labelledby="studio-title"><div class="studio-section-line"><span>EZERWRIGHT / THE STUDIO</span><span>02</span></div><div class="studio-statement-grid"><h2 id="studio-title" data-reveal>From a good business<br/>to an <em>unmistakable presence.</em></h2><div><p>We bring design and development together to make websites with a point of view—and a practical next step.</p><a href="/approach/">A little about our process <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="studio-principles"><article><span>01 / STRATEGY</span><h3>Know the next move.</h3><p>Understand the business, the customer and the action that matters.</p></article><article><span>02 / DESIGN</span><h3>Give it a presence.</h3><p>A distinct visual direction, considered details and room to breathe.</p></article><article><span>03 / BUILD</span><h3>Make it work.</h3><p>Responsive pages, a real enquiry route and portable source you own.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="studio-offering" aria-labelledby="studio-offer-title"><div class="studio-section-line"><span>A CLEAR STARTING POINT</span><span>03</span></div><div class="studio-offer-grid"><div><h2 id="studio-offer-title">Considered design.<br/><span>Clearly defined.</span></h2><p>A five-page website for your business. A real scope, a working enquiry route and a handover that keeps you in control.</p><a class="studio-link" href="/services/">Explore the full scope <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="studio-price"><span>THE DEFINED WEBSITE BUILD</span><p>US$<strong>500</strong></p><span>$250 to start after written approval.<br/>$250 after accepted staging.</span><ul><li>Up to five marketing pages</li><li>Two consolidated revision rounds</li><li>Client-owned, portable source</li></ul></div></div><div class="studio-future"><span>IN DEVELOPMENT</span><p>Looking beyond the interface.<br/><strong>AI-app source-code security reviews.</strong></p><a href="/audits/">Explore the direction <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span>COMING SOON · NO AUDIT BOOKINGS YET</span></div></section>
<section class="studio-enquiry" aria-labelledby="studio-enquiry-title"><div><p class="studio-overline">SOMETHING IN MIND?</p><h2 id="studio-enquiry-title">Let’s give<br/>it <em>form.</em></h2><p>A new website, a clearer experience,<br/>or a considered next chapter.</p><a class="studio-link" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="studio-enquiry-note">Start by email. No call required.</p></div><ProjectBrief/></section>
</div>
